e you contact any firm</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Banker Law Group, P.C.</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Personal injury law firm \u2014 Anchorage, AK</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>State directory example</li><li>Compare case fit, fees, communication, and verification</li><li>Use the city page to compare fit, fees, and case handling</li><li>Verify license and disciplinary history before you contact any firm</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Barber &amp; Associates, LLC</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Personal injury law firm \u2014 Anchorage, AK</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>State directory example</li><li>Compare case fit, fees, communication, and verification</li><li>Use the city page to compare fit, fees, and case handling</li><li>Verify license and disciplinary history before you contact any firm</li></ul></article><article class=\"provider-card\" data-provider-card=\"true\"><h3 class=\"provider-card__name\">Farnsworth &amp; Vance</h3><p class=\"provider-card__meta\" data-provider-card-meta=\"true\">Personal injury law firm \u2014 Anchorage, AK</p><ul class=\"provider-card__attributes\" data-provider-card-attributes=\"true\"><li>State directory example</li><li>Compare case fit, fees, communication, and verification</li><li>Use the city page to compare fit, fees, and case handling</li><li>Verify license and disciplinary history before you contact any firm</li></ul></article></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section faq-entry-card\" data-home-faq-entry=\"true\"><h2>Need quick answers first?</h2><p class=\"muted\">Use the FAQ when you want definitions, costs, timing questions, and fast clarification before you ope